- ```
+ ```

- The winds are ordinary enumerations, so a bearing can be matched, stored and shown like any
- other value:
+ Die Winde sind gewöhnliche Aufzählungen, sodass eine Peilung wie jeder andere Wert abgeglichen,
+ gespeichert und angezeigt werden kann:

- ```tabular
+ ```tabular

- column  Rose
+ column  Rose

- column  Resolves to
- column  Bearing given
+ column  Wird aufgelöst zu
+ column  Peilungs-given

- row  `Compass[4]`  `CardinalWind`: `North`, `East`, `South`, `West`  `compassBearings.fourPointCompassBearing`
+ row  `Compass[4]`  `CardinalWind`: `North`, `East`, `South`, `West`  `compassBearings.fourPointCompassBearing`

- row  `Compass[8]`  `CardinalWind` or `IntercardinalWind`, adding `Northeast`, `Southeast`, `Southwest`, `Northwest`  `compassBearings.eightPointCompassBearing`
- row  `Compass[16]`  any of those or a `HalfWind`, adding `NorthNortheast`, `EastNortheast` and the other six  `compassBearings.sixteenPointCompassBearing`
+ row  `Compass[8]`  `CardinalWind` oder `IntercardinalWind`, mit zusätzlich `Northeast`, `Southeast`, `Southwest`, `Northwest`  `compassBearings.eightPointCompassBearing`
+ row  `Compass[16]`  eines davon oder ein `HalfWind`, mit zusätzlich `NorthNortheast`, `EastNortheast` und den anderen sechs  `compassBearings.sixteenPointCompassBearing`

= row  `Compass[16]`  any of those or a `HalfWind`, adding `NorthNortheast`, `EastNortheast` and the other six  `compassBearings.sixteenPointCompassBearing`
- ```
